@startuml
!include _style.puml
left to right direction
title F07 HR 角色用例图
actor "招聘人员 HR" as HR
actor "DeepSeek 服务" as LLM
actor "Lever / JSON Resume\n公开资料服务" as Public
rectangle "SmartHire 系统边界" {
  usecase "UC01 注册与登录" as Login
  usecase "UC02 管理本人简历库\n上传 / 查询 / 预览 / 删除" as Resumes
  usecase "UC03 AI 解析简历" as Parse
  usecase "UC04 管理本人岗位\n创建 / 编辑 / 关闭 / 删除" as Jobs
  usecase "UC05 AI 分析岗位" as JD
  usecase "UC06 批量匹配候选人" as Match
  usecase "UC07 查看本人招聘报告" as Reports
  usecase "UC08 导入真实公开资料" as Imports
  usecase "校验角色与资源归属" as Ownership
  usecase "执行匹配分析流水线" as Pipeline
}
HR --> Login
HR --> Resumes
HR --> Parse
HR --> Jobs
HR --> JD
HR --> Match
HR --> Reports
HR --> Imports
Match .> Ownership : <<include>>
Match .> Pipeline : <<include>>
LLM --> Parse
LLM --> JD
LLM --> Pipeline
Public --> Imports
note bottom of Ownership
已登录是业务用例的前置条件。
HR 仅管理自己账号下的简历与岗位。
本地 admin 也是 HR，不是独立平台管理员角色。
end note
footer UML 用例图 | include 从基础用例指向必需子用例
@enduml
